  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nP(A) = (1/3)\n\nP(B) = (1/4)\n\nP(A ∪ B) = (1/2)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nP(A ∪ B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A ∩ B)\n\nP(A ∩ B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A ∪ B)\n\nP(A|B) = P(A ∩ B) / P(B)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nP(A ∪ B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A ∩ B)\n\n(1/2) = (1/3) + (1/4) - P(A ∩ B)\n\n(1/2) = (4/12) + (3/12) - P(A ∩ B)\n\n(1/2) = (7/12) - P(A ∩ B)\n\n⇒ P(A ∩ B) = (7/12) - (6/12)\n\n⇒ P(A ∩ B) = (1/12)\n\nP(A|B) = P(A ∩ B) / P(B)\n\n⇒ P(A|B) = (1/12) / (1/4)\n\n⇒ P(A|B) = (1/12) × (4/1)\n\n⇒ P(A|B) = (4/12)\n\n⇒ P(A|B) = (1/3)\n\n**The correct answer is option 1.**",
